@baseUrl = http://localhost:5182

### Valid batch: 2 real sample instructions. Every field satisfies the validation rules.
### Expect: 200 OK, Success: true, ConvertedText populated (header + 2 details + self-balancing
### contra record + trailer, per F-014), Errors: null.
POST {{baseUrl}}/convert
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "paymentTypeCode": "DE",
    "accountNo": "S1605677",
