### Unsupported paymentTypeCode ("BPAY" instead of "DE") on instruction 0 — whole batch rejected
### in full. Only the paymentTypeCode is invalid; everything else matches the valid batch above so
### the failure is isolated. Expect: 200 OK, Success: false, Errors: ["Unsupported payment type
### 'BPAY'."] tied to instruction index 0.
