### Only 1 instruction — F-014 reduced the minimum from 2 to 1, since the self-balancing contra
### record the service now adds itself already satisfies the Direct Entry spec's minimum-2-detail-
### record structural rule. The single instruction is fully valid, so the batch now succeeds.
### Expect: 200 OK, Success: true, ConvertedText populated (header + 1 detail + self-balancing
### contra record + trailer), Errors: null.
POST {{baseUrl}}/convert
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "paymentTypeCode": "DE",
    "accountNo": "S1605677",
    "paymentSourceTypeCode": "CMA",
    "sourceBankAccountName": "SOPHIA CLARK",
